      "evidence": "Reports that the shared per-user scope was disposed; the document carries no payload with it, so it says nothing further about what survives"
    },
    {
      "method": "installation.update-available",
      "class": "observation",
      "evidence": "Reports that a newer release exists; it installs nothing"
    },
